sequenceDiagram
  actor User
  participant UI as Older React App.js flow
  participant API as Root server.js
  participant Disk as uploads/ local disk
  participant PDF as pdf-lib
  User->>UI: select PDF
  UI->>API: POST /api/upload multipart
  API->>Disk: Multer saves uploaded file
  API->>PDF: load PDF and inspect AcroForm fields
  PDF-->>API: field names, types, widget rectangles
  API-->>UI: upload filename and detected field metadata
  Note over UI,API: App.js may not be selected by the extensionless App import; client/src/index.js also has App.tsx.
  Note over API,Disk: README says secure storage, auth, validation, malware scanning, audit, and privacy controls remain production gaps.
